["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">反</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>反；反对；相反；反转；违反</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ハン・ホン・タン・ホ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">そ.る・そ.らす・かえ.す・かえ.る・-かえ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">反対</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はんたい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">反对；抵抗；对抗；敌意；异议；反对意见；反面；相反；反向；相对</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">違反</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いはん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">违反；违背；违规；违犯；侵犯；违抗</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">反抗</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はんこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">反抗；抵抗；抗拒；违抗；敌对；叛逆</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">参</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>参加；拜访；来；去；死亡</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サン・シン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">まい.る・まい-・まじわる・みつ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">参る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まいる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">去；来；拜访；被击败；崩溃；死亡；烦恼；不知所措；疯狂地爱上；参拜；祭奠</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">参加</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さんか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">参加；参与；加入</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">参考</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さんこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">参考；查阅</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">利</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>利益；有利；利息；奏效；锋利</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">リ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">き.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">便利</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">べんり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">便利；方便；实用</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">利用</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">りよう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">使用；利用；应用</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">権利</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けんり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">权利；特权</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">組</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>组；编；合作；组装；搭档</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">く.む・くみ・-ぐみ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">番組</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ばんぐみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（电视等）节目；电视节目</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">組</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">班级；小组；队；班组；一批；一套；一组；犯罪家族；有组织犯罪团伙；套；组；副；一套；排版；排字；组版</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">組合</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くみあい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">协会；工会；行会；合作社；联合会</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">信</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>信任；真实；忠实；信用</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">信仰</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（宗教）信仰；信念；信条</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">信号</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんごう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">信号；发信号；红绿灯；交通信号灯</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">信用</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんよう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">信任；信赖；信用；名誉；信用贷款；赊账</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">在</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>存在；位于；在（某处）；郊区；suburbs</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ザイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">現在</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">げんざい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">现在；当前；此刻；截至；现在时；现在式；现世；今生；实际存在；现实存在；就在眼前存在</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">存在</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そんざい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">存在；实在；存有</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">滞在</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たいざい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">停留；逗留</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">件</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>事件；事项；案件；前述</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">くだん</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">事件</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じけん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">事件；事故；案件；情节；麻烦；丑闻</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">条件</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じょうけん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">条件；条款；要求；资格；前提</span></