g=\"ja\">投</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>投掷；抛弃；放弃；加入；投资</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">トウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">な.げる・-な.げ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">投げる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なげる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">投掷；抛；扔；甩；放弃；抛弃；丢弃；投射；投出（目光、影子、怀疑等）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">投票</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とうひょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">投票；表决；选票</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">投書</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とうしょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">投书；读者来信；投诉信；（向报刊）投稿</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">示</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>显示；指示；表示；表达；指出</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジ・シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しめ.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">掲示</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいじ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">通知；公告；张贴；公示；告示</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">示す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しめす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">展示；示范；说明；举例；表明；指向；指示（手指、时针、指针等）；表示；显示；代表；意味；呈现</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">暗示</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あんじ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">暗示；提示；线索；言外之意；（心理学）暗示；心理暗示</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">変</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>奇怪；变化；异常；改变；不寻常</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヘン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">か.わる・か.わり・か.える</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">変</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">へん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">奇怪；奇异；怪异；离奇；可疑；意外；出人意料；变化；改变；事变；骚乱；灾难；事故；紧急情况；（音乐）降（表示降半音，用作前缀）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">変える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">改变；改造；转变；转换；变更；改革；修订；修改</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">変わる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かわる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">改变；转变；变化；搬迁；移居；不同寻常；与众不同</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">打</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>打击；敲击；拍打；殴打；打（一打，十二个）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ダ・ダース</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">う.つ・う.ち-・ぶ.つ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">打つ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">打；击；敲；拍；捶；砸；鸣；敲；击（鼓等）；有节奏地跳动；（波浪等）拍打；感动；打动；触动；钉入；锤入；打入；注射；接种；打字；发送；传送；插入；写入；标记；制作（面条等）；准备；耕；耕耘；撒；洒；投；掷；做；执行；进行；表演；从事（赌博等）；交付；支付（定金等）；朝圣；参拜；缝衬里；缝内衬；束缚；绑缚（罪犯）；（将棋）打入（持驹）；（围棋）落子；着手；下围棋</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">打合せ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うちあわせ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（准备性）会议；简报会；提前安排；（衣服等的）重叠部分；搭接；完全匹配；对齐</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">打ち消す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うちけす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">否认；反驳；抵消（尤指声音）；盖过；淹没</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">直</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>直接；正直；修理；立即；矫正</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チョク・ジキ・ジカ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ただ.ちに・なお.す・-なお.す・なお.る・なお.き・す.ぐ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">直す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なおす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">修理；修补；修好；改正；纠正；恢复；整理；振作；改变；转换；翻译；放回；收起；治疗；医治；升职；晋升；重做；再做一遍</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">直る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なおる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">被修理；被修好；被修复；恢复正常；康复；恢复；改善；好转；恢复如初；被改正；被纠正；被整正；自愈；治愈；坐直；坐端正；被提升；升职；罪行被赦免；获得宽恕</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">直</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">即将；不久；很快；邻近；附近；直接；直系；现货交易；现金交易</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">両</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>两；两个；古日本货币单位；车厢（列车等的计数单位）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">リョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">てる・ふたつ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">両親</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">りょうしん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">父母</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">両方</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">りょうほう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">两方；双方；两边</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">両替</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">りょうがえ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">兑换；换钱</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">式</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>仪式；形式；样式；方法；式样</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シキ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">式</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">方式；风格；样式；方法；体制；形式；类型；仪式；仪礼；典礼；庆典；婚礼；婚礼仪式；方程式；公式；表达式；（律令法的）施行细则</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">正式</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せいしき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">正式的；官方的；正规的；合乎手续的；合法的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">儀式</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぎしき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">仪式；典礼；仪礼；仪轨</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">容</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>容纳；形态；容貌</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヨウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">い.れる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">内容</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ないよう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">内容</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">容易</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ようい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">容易；简单；轻易</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">美容</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">びよう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">美貌；容貌；美的外表；美的五官；美化；美容护理；美容文化；化妆品</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">演</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>表演；演出；扮演；演讲；演奏</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">エン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">演技</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えんぎ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">演技；表演</span></li><li><span class=\"