\">イ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">くらい・ぐらい</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">位</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くらい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">王位；皇位；（贵族的）座位；政府职位；朝廷官阶；社会地位；身份；等级；阶层；阶级；品质等级；水平；层级；等第；数位；位数；（小数）位</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">位置</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">地方；位置；所在地；地位；身份；处境</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">単位</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たんい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">单位（如米、克等）；计量单位；单位（由多个部分组成的整体）；群体；整体；学分；（学业）积分；按…；以…为单位；每…</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">置</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>放置；设置；留下；存放；使用</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">お.く・-お.き</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">置く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">放置；放；搁；留下；遗留；建立；设置；创办；任命；聘用；雇用；寄托；寄予；铭记；放下（工具）；搁笔；留宿；提供住处；分隔；间隔；提前做；事先进行；保持某种状态；维持某种状态</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">位置</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">地方；位置；所在地；地位；身份；处境</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">装置</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そうち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">设备；装置；器械；舞台布景；布景</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">流</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>流动；水流；趋势；冲走；放弃</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">リュウ・ル</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><